### PHASE 3 (step 3.4): billing now requires "authorization: Bearer <token>" with the permission
# create:billing-accounts (BearerTokenInterceptor). Only the patient-service app in Auth0 has it,
# so with your test token this request answers PERMISSION_DENIED, and without the header
# UNAUTHENTICATED - both are the expected, secure answers. patient-service calls billing itself.
# PHASE 3 (old): (same request without the authorization line)
GRPC localhost:9001/BillingService/CreateBillingAccount
authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "patientId": "12345",
  "name": "user ",
  "email" : "user@example.com"
}
